        "TileImage": "$($repository 270c38fa-0c5d-4ce6-93a1-15de1231ab43).Image",
        "Description": "With Freelancer on the horizon and nearing release in 10 days, I have decided to bide my time(and cope) by making one contract per day until Freelancer&apos;s eventual release using the Hitman roulette.\rContinuing the hunt for the gun trafficking syndicate has lead you to Miami, where it seems Kronstadt has been sponsoring this endeavor in the shadows. Do what you do best, 47.\rOptional objective; Use the stand-in photo stand near the marina.\rI hope you enjoy, and look forward to Freelancer!",
